Windows Registry Editor Version 5.00

; Game Bar off — disables the Xbox Game Bar overlay
; Source: appears in Aphrodite Aim Assist .bat (but that file also downloads malware — do NOT run it)
; Registry: HKCU\Software\Microsoft\GameBar\UseNexusForGameBarEnabled
; Value 0 = Game Bar disabled. Default 1 = enabled.
; Pairs with gamedvr-off.reg for full Game Bar/DVR disable.
; Revert: set back to 1

[HKEY_CURRENT_USER\Software\Microsoft\GameBar]
"UseNexusForGameBarEnabled"=dword:00000000
"ShowStartupPanel"=dword:00000000
